            "review_title": "Review at Hang Me Hue",
            "review_text": "Teaveex3\n27 contributions\n0\nBest Bun Bo, strange banh bot loc\nAug 2016 • Solo\nThe Bun Bo Hue here is VERY good. The best I've had since I've been in Danang (only tried about 3 others). Cheap price as usual with these smaller places, but the banh bot loc were bad. They were made in a peanut/sweet sauce that is not consistent with the flavor I'm used to. Although they did put pork inside, they only used the fat part of the meat which wasn't that enjoyable to me.\n\nThe restaurant doesn't show up in the right place on Google maps.\nThey're located on the left going down Tran Phu. Big purple sign to help you find it. Right after Hot and Cold.\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2016",
